: Sorry, but I missed your original post but reading your subject it kind
: of sounds similar to a problem I once had. Have you tried excluding your
: upper memory block area? By this I mean excluding everything in your
: UMB from A000-FFFF. This is done in your config.sys on the himem line.
: My problem was that my video card was somehow interfering with my sound 
: card and by using the above exclusion and then narrowing it down, I was 
: able to exclude a 16K area and fix my problem. Hope this helps.

